      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹32.21 (vs ₹16.60 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹32.21 (up from ₹16.60 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.2b (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹733.5m (up 97% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.0% (up from 3.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 48% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 65% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
